{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>不少人靠番茄鐘維持專注，但計時器往往只顯示跳動的數字，動力有限。CabFlow 把每一節專注時間變成一段看得見的駕駛旅程，選定行程後車輛會隨時間駛向目的地，適合容易分心、需要額外推動力的上班族與學生。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>把專注時間變成可見旅程</h2>\n<p>CabFlow 把番茄鐘計時變成模擬駕駛體驗。使用者可先選擇行程，時間流逝時車輛會穩定駛向目的地，全程不鎖定手機，也不監測是否離開應用程式。內置上海、東京、紐約、三藩市、倫敦與柏林六個城市，配合 iOS 27 的 Flyover 俯瞰街景。完成行程可累積積分，解鎖不同風格車輛。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-404-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-405-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-406-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-407-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-408-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-409-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：CabFlow-Immersive Focus Timer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T14:19:18.089018+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}